  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yacyret&#xe1; A&#xf1;a Cu&#xe1; Hydroelectric Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to expand the Yacyret&#xe1;hydropower by increasing renewable generation capacity and optimizing existing water flows to strengthen energy supply in Argentina and Paraguay, while avoiding the need for a new reservoir. Its scope includes the construction of a new plant at the A&#xf1;a Cu&#xe1; branch with 270 MWof installed capacity, along with associated civil works, transmission infrastructure, substations, interconnection systems, and environmental and social management measures.</narrative>
  </description>
